  "fixture_kind": "public_exact-list_card_data",
  "rulings": [
    {
      "comment": "The controller of Vedalken Orrery can cast nonland artifact, creature, enchantment, and sorcery cards any time they could cast an instant. This includes on other players' turns and during the upkeep step, draw step, combat phase, and end step.",
      "oracle_id": "60d640a4-032b-4279-ac75-8f200ca776fb",
      "published_at": "2004-12-01",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "This applies only to casting spells. It does not, for example, change when you may activate abilities that can only be activated \"any time you could cast a sorcery\".",
      "oracle_id": "60d640a4-032b-4279-ac75-8f200ca776fb",
      "published_at": "2010-06-15",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won't return to the battlefield.",
      "oracle_id": "6879f5ce-7a1b-4606-bad1-885779b0d456",
      "published_at": "2018-03-16",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Once the exiled permanent returns, it's considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled permanent will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist.",
      "oracle_id": "6879f5ce-7a1b-4606-bad1-885779b0d456",
      "published_at": "2018-03-16",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "The returned card won't be the target of any spells or abilities that targeted it before. Any spells that don't target, such as Akroma's Vengeance, will still affect it.",
      "oracle_id": "6879f5ce-7a1b-4606-bad1-885779b0d456",
      "published_at": "2018-03-16",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "When an effect returns the exiled card \"under your control,\" you control it indefinitely after that. In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any creatures you control from Cloudshift's effect are exiled.",
      "oracle_id": "6879f5ce-7a1b-4606-bad1-885779b0d456",
      "published_at": "2018-03-16",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Act of Treason can target any creature, even one that's untapped or one you already control.",
      "oracle_id": "9d08af23-9f4a-4097-9abc-3b17475ab744",
      "published_at": "2019-07-12",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Gaining control of a creature doesn't cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it.",
      "oracle_id": "9d08af23-9f4a-4097-9abc-3b17475ab744",
      "published_at": "2019-07-12",
      "source": "wotc"
    }
  ],
